obj_id: agentGenerated_SouthRegionSalesPerformanceRisks-adea6a94
liveboard:
  name: agentGenerated_South Region Sales Performance Risks
  visualizations:
  - id: Viz_1
    viz_guid: 9fe69a73-9be3-4c7e-936d-86f99ad48edc
    note_tile:
      html_parsed_string: |-
        Key Drivers:
        • South region performs worst nationally with only 54% of top region's sales and 43% of profit
        • Tables and Machines sub-categories operate at losses of -$4,623 and -$1,439 respectively
        • Furniture category has critically low 5.8% profit margin, less than half of other categories
        • High discount rates (33% on Machines, 37% on Binders) directly correlate with losses

        Recommendations:
        • Discontinue or restructure Tables and Machines product lines to stop losses
        • Reduce discount rates below 20% and implement stricter discount approval process
        • Focus sales efforts on profitable Technology and Office Supplies categories
  - id: Viz_2
    answer:
      name: Total sales and total profit by region
      tables:
